[2026-11-18T12:15:16.952Z] [DEBUG] [rpc] github←resp 5760b {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","src":"data:image/png;base64,","theme":"light"},{"mimeType":"image/png","src":"data:image/png;base64,","theme":"dark"}],"name":"github-mcp-server","title":"GitHub MCP Server","version":"v2.1.0"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"additions\":16,\"base\":{\"ref\":\"main\",\"repo\":{\"description\":\"Open EV and charging-network data for Charge Line, kept current by GitHub Agentic Workflows with Claude\",\"full_name\":\"Suv4o/charge-line-data\"},\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\"},\"body\":\"- **Schedule:** the catalogue agent now runs monthly on the 1st (was the 1st and 15th). Prices stays on the 8th.\\n- **Catalogue caps:** `max-ai-credits` 300 → 1000 (US$10 a run) and `max-daily-ai-credits` 600 → 2000. The Opus 5.5 preview hit the US$3 cap at 21 minutes, before proposing anything; this lets it finish so the two models can be compared properly. The caps get tuned once a model is chosen.\\n- **README:** schedule and caps wording.\\n\\nBoth agents stay in staged mode.\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\"changed_files\":3,\"closed_at\":\"2026-11-18T12:10:52Z\",\"commits\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-18T12:10:32Z\",\"deletions\":15,\"draft\":false,\"head\":{\"ref\":\"chore/monthly-and-caps\",\"repo\":{\"description\":\"Open EV and charging-network data for Charge Line, kept current by GitHub Agentic Workflows with Claude\",\"full_name\":\"Suv4o/charge-line-data\"},\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\"},\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/Suv4o/charge-line-data/pull/11\",\"mergeable_state\":\"unknown\",\"merged\":true,\"merged_at\":\"2026-11-18T12:10:52Z\",\"merged_by\":\"Suv4o\",\"number\":11,\"state\":\"closed\",\"title\":\"Both agents monthly; catalogue cap raised for the Opus comparison\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-18T12:10:54Z\",\"user\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56303591?v=4\",\"id\":56303591,\"login\":\"Suv4o\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/Suv4o\"}}"}],"structuredContent":{"additions":16,"base":{"ref":"main","repo":{"description":"Open EV and charging-network data for Charge Line, kept current by GitHub Agentic Workflows with Claude","full_name":"Suv4o/charge-line-data"},"sha":"[REDACTED]"},"body":"- **Schedule:** the catalogue agent now runs monthly on the 1st (was the 1st and 15th). Prices stays on the 8th.\n- **Catalogue caps:** `max-ai-credits` 300 → 1000 (US$10 a run) and `max-daily-ai-credits` 600 → 2000. The Opus 5.5 preview hit the US$3 cap at 21 minutes, before proposing anything; this lets it finish so the two models can be compared properly. The caps get tuned once a model is chosen.\n- **README:** schedule and caps wording.\n\nBoth agents stay in staged mode.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","changed_files":3,"closed_at":"2026-11-18T12:10:52Z","commits":1,"created_at":"2026-11-18T12:10:32Z","deletions":15,"draft":false,"head":{"ref":"chore/monthly-and-caps","repo":{"description":"Open EV and charging-network data for Charge Line, kept current by GitHub Agentic Workflows with Claude","full_name":"Suv4o/charge-line-data"},"sha":"[REDACTED]"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Suv4o/charge-line-data/pull/11","mergeable_state":"unknown","merged":true,"merged_at":"2026-11-18T12:10:52Z","merged_by":"Suv4o","number":11,"state":"closed","title":"Both agents monthly; catalogue cap raised for the Opus comparison","updated_at":"2026-11-18T12:10:54Z","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56303591?v=4","id":56303591,"login":"Suv4o","profile_url":"https://github.com/Suv4o"}},"resultType":"complete"}}
