[2026-11-18T12:15:17.498Z] [DEBUG] [rpc] github←resp 5670b {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","src":"data:image/png;base64,","theme":"light"},{"mimeType":"image/png","src":"data:image/png;base64,","theme":"dark"}],"name":"github-mcp-server","title":"GitHub MCP Server","version":"v2.1.0"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"additions\":52,\"base\":{\"ref\":\"main\",\"repo\":{\"description\":\"Open EV and charging-network data for Charge Line, kept current by GitHub Agentic Workflows with Claude\",\"full_name\":\"Suv4o/charge-line-data\"},\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\"},\"body\":\"Adds a `model` choice to the manual **Run workflow** button of both agents:\\n\\n- scheduled runs keep **Claude Sonnet 5.5**\\n- a manual run can pick **Claude Opus 5.5**, to compare cost and results on the same job:\\n  `gh aw run catalogue --raw-field model=claude-opus-5-5`\\n\\nThe model is now an expression (`${{ inputs.model || 'claude-sonnet-5-5' }}`), so gh-aw's firewall prices it at run time instead of compile time. Both agents stay in staged mode.\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\"changed_files\":4,\"closed_at\":\"2026-11-18T11:26:25Z\",\"commits\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-18T11:26:04Z\",\"deletions\":24,\"draft\":false,\"head\":{\"ref\":\"feat/model-choice\",\"repo\":{\"description\":\"Open EV and charging-network data for Charge Line, kept current by GitHub Agentic Workflows with Claude\",\"full_name\":\"Suv4o/charge-line-data\"},\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\"},\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/Suv4o/charge-line-data/pull/7\",\"mergeable_state\":\"unknown\",\"merged\":true,\"merged_at\":\"2026-11-18T11:26:25Z\",\"merged_by\":\"Suv4o\",\"number\":7,\"state\":\"closed\",\"title\":\"Manual runs can choose the model (Sonnet 5.5 or Opus 5.5)\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-18T11:26:27Z\",\"user\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56303591?v=4\",\"id\":56303591,\"login\":\"Suv4o\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/Suv4o\"}}"}],"structuredContent":{"additions":52,"base":{"ref":"main","repo":{"description":"Open EV and charging-network data for Charge Line, kept current by GitHub Agentic Workflows with Claude","full_name":"Suv4o/charge-line-data"},"sha":"[REDACTED]"},"body":"Adds a `model` choice to the manual **Run workflow** button of both agents:\n\n- scheduled runs keep **Claude Sonnet 5.5**\n- a manual run can pick **Claude Opus 5.5**, to compare cost and results on the same job:\n  `gh aw run catalogue --raw-field model=claude-opus-5-5`\n\nThe model is now an expression (`${{ inputs.model || 'claude-sonnet-5-5' }}`), so gh-aw's firewall prices it at run time instead of compile time. Both agents stay in staged mode.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","changed_files":4,"closed_at":"2026-11-18T11:26:25Z","commits":1,"created_at":"2026-11-18T11:26:04Z","deletions":24,"draft":false,"head":{"ref":"feat/model-choice","repo":{"description":"Open EV and charging-network data for Charge Line, kept current by GitHub Agentic Workflows with Claude","full_name":"Suv4o/charge-line-data"},"sha":"[REDACTED]"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Suv4o/charge-line-data/pull/7","mergeable_state":"unknown","merged":true,"merged_at":"2026-11-18T11:26:25Z","merged_by":"Suv4o","number":7,"state":"closed","title":"Manual runs can choose the model (Sonnet 5.5 or Opus 5.5)","updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:26:27Z","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56303591?v=4","id":56303591,"login":"Suv4o","profile_url":"https://github.com/Suv4o"}},"resultType":"complete"}}
